    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Please analyze whether this candidate is a strong fit for the following role and provide a detailed justification.\n\nJOB DETAILS:\nTarget Company: {{ $json.output.company_name }}\nJob Description: {{ $json.output.job_description }}\nInitial Match Rating: {{ $json.output.rating }}\n\nCANDIDATE INFO (MY RESUME):\n{{ $('Extract from File').first().json.text }}\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\nIdentify the top 3-5 required skills or qualifications from the job description.\nMap each requirement to specific, verifiable evidence from the candidate resume.\nHighlight the candidate's strongest matching points.\nIdentify any gaps or areas where the candidate may need to develop further.\nProvide an overall fit assessment with a clear recommendation.\nOutput a structured, professional justification of 200-250 words.\nBase everything strictly on the resume - do not invent or assume any experience.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are an expert Technical Recruiter and Career Advisor with deep knowledge of software engineering roles.\n\nYour task is to provide a detailed, honest fit analysis between a candidate resume and a job description.\n\nSTRICT RULES\nDo NOT invent achievements, responsibilities, or skills.\nBase analysis strictly on the provided resume.\nBe honest about both strengths and gaps.\n\nSTRUCTURE\n1. Top Matching Strengths: 3-5 bullet points mapping job requirements to resume evidence\n2. Potential Gaps: 1-3 honest gaps or areas for development\n3. Overall Recommendation: A clear fit verdict with reasoning\n\nSTYLE\nTone: professional, objective, concise\nWord count: 200-250 words\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT\nProduce only the structured justification body."
        }
      },
